    "title": "List account meetings",
    "category": "Customer analytics",
    "description": "List synced calendar meetings for one Customer analytics account, newest first. Each meeting includes its title, start and end times, organizer, status, optional Gong call URL, and participants. Each participant includes their email, display name, RSVP status, organizer status, and resolved PostHog person UUID when available. Pass `search` to filter by meeting title, attendee email, or attendee name. The account must be accessible to the caller. Meetings and participants are read-only because they sync from connected calendars.",
